# (Not the LOD: docs/lod.md choice 8.) 2-cycle, the second cycle TEXEL1. Tile 0 a 4-texel ramp (red, black, black,
# green, wrapping), tile 1 blue; an affine triangle, S one texel a pixel, point sampled. The oracle's second-cycle TEXEL1
# is the next pixel's first texel (tile 0, one texel on); the model's is the pixel's own first texel (tile 0, here).
